\section{Global TSSE Invariants}

TSSE engines preserve the following invariants:

\begin{enumerate}
  \item Temporal symmetry:
  \[
  \mathcal{T}\mathcal{U}(t) = \mathcal{U}(t)\mathcal{T}.
  \]

  \item Phase-space volume:
  \[
  \det(D\mathcal{U}(t)) = 1.
  \]

  \item Structural manifold closure:
  \[
  \mathcal{U}(t)\mathcal{S}_{\text{TSSE}} = \mathcal{S}_{\text{TSSE}}.
  \]

  \item Hamiltonian conservation:
  \[
  \frac{dH_{\text{TSSE}}}{dt} = 0.
  \]
\end{enumerate}

\begin{theorem}[TSSE Global Invariant Preservation]
All TSSE invariants are preserved under admissible evolution.
\end{theorem}

\begin{proof}
Each invariant is preserved by its subsystem kernel. Kernel composition preserves
invariants by Lemma 1 and Theorem 1.
\end{proof}

